WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.413 --> 00:00:01.687
PETER QUILL
We were criminals.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Friends.

00:00:03.851 --> 00:00:05.475
And then we became Guardians.

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:08.655
Are you ready for one last ride?

00:00:08.706 --> 00:00:09.913
ROCKET
Let's make it count.

00:00:10.065 --> 00:00:12.656
GROOT
We...are...Groooot!

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.359
THE HIGH EVOLUTIONARY
I will destroy the Guardians.

00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:18.941
GAMORA
[Screams]

00:00:19.329 --> 00:00:20.555
PETER QUILL
It's a face-off.

00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:22.068
I guess we'll die trying.

00:00:23.732 --> 00:00:24.690
GROOT
I am Groot.

00:00:24.748 --> 00:00:26.382
GAMORA
I know who you are already!

00:00:26.433 --> 00:00:27.335
ROCKET
[Laughing]

